error[B0500]: .opacity() fades a view that holds glass
  --> check/chains.bloom:33:6
   |
33 |     .opacity("half")
   |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: on the web a faded ancestor flattens the material (it stops blurring); put the fade on the .glass() view itself, which fades the material's own layers instead
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-language-tour.mdx#liquid-glass-rules

error[B0500]: an icon-only Button has no .label()
 --> check/chains.bloom:8:9
  |
8 |         Button(Icon("share"))
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
help: name what it does: Button(Icon(…)).label('Share')
  = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-language-tour.mdx#accessibility

error[B0500]: glass on glass: this glass is inside another glass
  --> check/chains.bloom:10:21
   |
10 |           Text("b").glass(clear.dimmed())
   |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: Liquid Glass is one layer: drop this .glass(), or put both side by side in a GlassGroup
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-language-tour.mdx#liquid-glass-rules

error[B0500]: a Section with a .selection() holds its choices only
  --> check/chains.bloom:29:9
   |
29 |         Text("Two")
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: each row is a choice: Item(title).tag(value)
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-language-nodes.mdx#menusection

warning[B0500]: glass in scrolling content: glass belongs to the navigation layer
  --> check/chains.bloom:15:19
   |
15 |         Text("c").glass(regular)
   |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: put it on a bar, a toolbar or a floating control; a control in a row that is glass on purpose says so with .inContent()
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-language-tour.mdx#liquid-glass-rules

warning[B0500]: a glass per item of a list
  --> check/chains.bloom:21:28
   |
21 |         Button(Text(item)).style("glass")
   |                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: every lens is drawn each frame; a row's control that is glass on purpose says so with .inContent()
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-language-tour.mdx#liquid-glass-rules

warning[B0500]: a toolbar group mixes text and icon buttons
  --> check/chains.bloom:23:7
   |
23 |       ToolbarGroup {
   |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: Apple: keep actions with text labels apart; put them in groups of their own
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-language-tour.mdx#navigation
